		{
			dependencies: ["2823D7B4C8F900CA"]
			description: [
				"With &6HV Machine Hulls&r made, you've made your first step towards &eHigh Voltage (HV)&r power machinery!"
				""
				"While you can make these in a crafting table with &6Polyethylene Sheets&r, liquid &9Polyethylene&r can be used to craft these directly in an &3Assembler&r."
			]
			id: "15E34DEC491FAB81"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2994608F544B8B67"
