		{
			dependencies: ["74935A3553451178"]
			description: [
				"&6Empty Spray Cans&r can be filled with the liquid form of any color dye in a &3Canner&r. Once filled, they can dye any dye-able block (such as &6wool&r or &bAE2 &6cables&r) by simply right clicking. Cans alternatively can also be filled with solvent, causing them to un-dye clicked blocks."
				""
				"Hold shift when dyeing blocks to dye multiple connected blocks at once!"
				""
				"In addition to dye-able blocks, &bGregTech&r &6wires&r, &6cables&r, &6machines&r, &6hatches&r and &6buses&r can be dyed."
				""
				"Importantly, dyed &bGT&r hatches/buses behave differently than when undyed. When dyed, they will share their contents with all other hatches/buses on the multi that are dyed the same color or undyed. Hatches/buses of different colors will not share contents. This can be quite helpful when you need to have separate 'groups' of hatches/buses on a multiblock, such as when dealing with different program circuits."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "2C7306C74609E995"
			size: 1.5d
