		{
			dependencies: ["7DE2C9292A09FC76"]
			description: [
				"This is your first &3Microverse Projector&r."
				""
				"These structures are used to project &eMicroverses&r and send &6Microminers&r into them to obtain valuable loot such as &6ores&r, &6gems&r, and otherwise unobtainable items&r like &6Radon Salt&r and &6Naquadah&r. &eMost Microminers are &6fully reusable&r, including your first one.&r"
				""
				"Microverse Projectors are &bGregTech&r multiblocks, which means that they're just as flexible as other machines in terms of the I/O block placement: &epositions of Buses and Hatches can be swapped with any Microverse Projector Casing&r."
				""
				"A single &6HV Energy Input&r supports missions up to 1024 EU/t. To process the rest, you'll need to upgrade the multiblock to at least &eEV power&r, with either &6two HV Energy Inputs&r or &6one EV Energy Input&r. Missions will also overclock, increasing in speed each time the projector's energy tier increases."
				""
				"Hover your mouse over the projector and press &8U&r to see all available missions."
				""
				"&6Sneak-right click&r the controller to enable the in-world preview."
			]
