		{
			dependencies: ["193B7038EAB6EFA3"]
			description: [
				"The &3Oxygen Loader&r is used to load &9Oxygen&r into your Space Suit, making it usable for exploring the great beyond. It will need &aRedstone Flux (RF)&r to do so. You may alternatively use a &3Canner&r."
				""
				"If you run out of Oxygen, then you will &cSuffocate&r. If you plan to spend several hours on &bThe Moon&r, consider bringing an additional &6Gas Tank&r filled with &9Oxygen&r."
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:oxygen_loader"
