		{
			dependencies: ["281C7940CD437B69"]
			description: [
				"Now that you've been to the Moon, consider going to &6Other Planets&r."
				""
				"Each planet has abundant resources like the &eMoon&r and new, unique ores to boot. To get there, you need a &6Better Rocket&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"With a &3Tier Two Rocket&r you can make it to &eMars&r. Mars has &6Scheelite&r, &6Arsenopyrite&r, &6Carnotite&r, &6Borax&r, and veins of gaseous &9Fluorine&r."
				""
				"With a &3Tier Three Rocket&r you can make it to &eMercury&r and &eVenus&r. Before you go, make a &eNetherite Space Suit&r, otherwise the atmosphere will &cburn you to death&r.\n\nMercury has &6Argentite&r for &eIndium&r, &6Plutonium&r, and &6Laurite&r, as well as fluid veins of &9Blazing Pyrotheum&r, &9Sodium Persulfate&r, and... &9Mercury&r.\nVenus has &6Xenotime&r, &6Gallite&r, &9Sulfuric Acid&r fluid veins, and lots of &6Platinum Group ores&r."
				""
				"With a &3Tier Four Rocket&r you can make it to &eGlacio&r. Glacio has &6Naquadah&r, &6Kaemanite&r, &6Stolzite&r, &6Iridosmine&r, and &6Osmiridium&r, as well as &6Gelid Cryotheum&r fluid veins."
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:glacio_globe"
			id: "62C85A1F451C4855"
			invisible: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "148F206D2B3F2EAF"
				item: "kubejs:moni_nickel"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "One must imagine Frank Sinatra happy."
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "ad_astra:moon"
				id: "199AA113DCFEBFDD"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			title: "&9...and Let Me Play Among the Stars"
			x: 27.0d
			y: 1.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0C4E18B05F9E68DE"]
			description: [
				"&6Drilling Kits&r are required to send &9Microminers&r on a variety of missions. These are cheap, so make sure you &9always keep a stock of them&r."
				""
				"Higher tier Microminers will use higher tiers of &6Drilling Kits&r, so get used to making them."
